heta =\\pi /4} & =\\frac{{y}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{4})}{{x}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{4})} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,{e}^{\\pi /2})}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,{e}^{\\pi /2})} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337887 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337888 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337889 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337890 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337891 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1041 "selection" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337887 13194139535213 true] [17592186337886 1110 #uuid "878319dc-5f9b-5a6b-a67e-192061f68d82" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337887 1034 "3" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337887 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535213 true] [17592186337887 1111 #uuid "7f2f47f4-aa3c-590c-81b2-92caf242497a" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337888 1034 "\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337888 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535213 true] [17592186337888 1111 #uuid "2fda00af-63ce-5268-b73c-092e60cb1f99" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337889 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337889 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535213 true] [17592186337889 1111 #uuid "c97dfd70-8f98-52fc-8df9-bdf4ad4e190a" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337890 1034 "3{e}^{\\pi /2}" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337890 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535213 true] [17592186337890 1111 #uuid "aba4ef22-40bb-5bcc-aca4-1eaa383c4290" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337891 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,{e}^{\\pi /2}" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337891 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535213 true] [17592186337891 1111 #uuid "62cac228-a0a4-5c20-a17d-3470c4b9fb12" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337892 1017 #edb/ref 17592186337893 13194139535213 true] [17592186337892 1089 "q-141048" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337892 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535213 true] [17592186337892 1100 "Find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the polar curve $r=2\\theta $  at $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ given that\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}(\\theta )=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +2\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,{x}^{′}(\\theta )=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -2\\theta \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\n$$" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337892 1113 #uuid "46df02d0-4baa-5092-ab18-1b78992d66ad" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337892 1145 "To find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ we use the rule\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(\\theta )}{{x}^{′}(\\theta )}.\n$$\n\nWe have,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2(\\frac{\\pi }{2})\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\frac{\\pi }{2} \\\\  & =2+0 \\\\  & =2,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\frac{\\pi }{2}-2(\\frac{\\pi }{2})\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\frac{\\pi }{2} \\\\  & =0-\\pi  \\\\  & =-\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{\\theta =\\pi /2} & =\\frac{{y}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{2})}{{x}^{′}(\\frac{\\pi }{2})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{-\\pi } \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337894 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337895 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337896 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337897 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337898 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1041 "selection" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337897 13194139535213 true] [17592186337893 1110 #uuid "ae77d6aa-2d15-52fc-b259-9b17badb1565" 13194139535213 true] [17592186337894 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194